    "name": "3M Partner and Supplier Deliveries Orders API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The 3M Partner and Supplier API provides real-time access to 3M product, pricing, order, delivery, and invoice data for partners and suppliers. The API supports GET and POST operations for product/price lookups, order and delivery tracking, and invoice status queries. Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 bearer tokens with client credentials provided during onboarding.",
